{"4262030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Fisherman", "steam_appid": 4262030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing fishing game with a unique twist: explore six different biomes in a post-apocalyptic world and catch over <strong>130 unique fish species</strong>. Every catch is documented with detailed descriptions and scientific facts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/e262ced1384aba0831f6a48364a17575.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/e262ced1384aba0831f6a48364a17575.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/e262ced1384aba0831f6a48364a17575.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐟 Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖 Extensive Fish Book</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>130 different fish species</strong> are waiting to be discovered. From common freshwater fish to rare and mysterious creatures, each species is uniquely designed with its own traits, weight ranges, and scientific background information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All discovered fish are automatically recorded in the <strong>Fish Book</strong>, where you can review:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Species descriptions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientific facts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal weight records</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch statistics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rarity tiers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your collection grows with every discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/6a434d09a61116827bfdae118e74c967.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/6a434d09a61116827bfdae118e74c967.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/6a434d09a61116827bfdae118e74c967.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 Six Unique Biomes to Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 <strong>Beach</strong><br>Calm coastal waters filled with diverse marine life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏢 <strong>City</strong><br>Urban waterways with adapted fish populations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚇 <strong>Subway</strong><br>Underground water systems hosting unusual species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 <strong>Forest</strong><br>Forest ponds and lakes with unique biodiversity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌵 <strong>Desert</strong><br>Rare oasis waters with extremely adapted fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❄️ <strong>Iceland</strong><br>Arctic seas inhabited by deep-sea species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❓ <strong>Secret</strong><br>???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome contains its own atmosphere, fish species, and hidden discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/32d96f81bb3d837107c633b00a7aa947.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/32d96f81bb3d837107c633b00a7aa947.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/32d96f81bb3d837107c633b00a7aa947.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏠 Central Hub</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between fishing expeditions you return to a <strong>central hub area</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >view your <strong>Fish Book</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >compare catches on the <strong>Leaderboards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >manage and sell your fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >upgrade your equipment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hub acts as your base before heading back out into the unknown waters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/8bc17d9c53ead6df334d3c81197ba4b3.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/8bc17d9c53ead6df334d3c81197ba4b3.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/8bc17d9c53ead6df334d3c81197ba4b3.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare your catches with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards track:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the <strong>largest fish caught</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rare discoveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >total fishing value</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the most dedicated anglers will reach the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌮 Food Truck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every fish needs to stay in your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the <strong>Food Truck</strong>, you can cook and sell fish to earn money. The value depends on species, rarity, and weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earned money can be invested into upgrades or specialized bait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/6f3b2050dbe3f4a210d23c91bb239c72.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/6f3b2050dbe3f4a210d23c91bb239c72.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/6f3b2050dbe3f4a210d23c91bb239c72.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚙️ Progression System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three upgrade categories allow you to continuously improve your fishing equipment:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grip</strong><br>Improves casting precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bait</strong><br>Increases the chance of rare catches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Line</strong><br>Reduces waiting time between bites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/969baf934ff4575d47409c8f3e82a1c9.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/969baf934ff4575d47409c8f3e82a1c9.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/969baf934ff4575d47409c8f3e82a1c9.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 Specialized Baits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different bait types can be purchased to target specific rarity tiers. This allows strategic fishing when hunting rare species.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹️ Gameplay Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise casting system with timing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythmic fishing mini-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economy system for selling fish and upgrading equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story items hidden within each biome</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Gameplay Loop</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fishing Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines classic fishing gameplay with modern mechanics and a <strong>small food-stand economy system</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After casting your line, you wait for a bite. Waiting time can be reduced through upgrades. Catching a fish triggers a <strong>skill-based mini-game</strong> focused on timing and reaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/a417fea9b246ace4284597ebd0db8e64.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/a417fea9b246ace4284597ebd0db8e64.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/a417fea9b246ace4284597ebd0db8e64.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collection &amp; Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caught fish can be:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sold for money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cooked and sold at the <strong>Food Truck</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >kept in your inventory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Fish Book</strong> automatically records all discovered species and personal records.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Biome System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome can be unlocked through the <strong>map menu</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different environments feature unique fish populations, atmosphere, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/ce95004ef06899220afb22c2c3592dbf.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/ce95004ef06899220afb22c2c3592dbf.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/ce95004ef06899220afb22c2c3592dbf.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📊 Game Content</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rarity Tiers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common — <strong>40% spawn rate</strong><br>Uncommon — <strong>30%</strong><br>Rare — <strong>15%</strong><br>Epic — <strong>10%</strong><br>Legendary — <strong>4%</strong><br>Exotic — <strong>1%</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient</strong> — Story items</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Economy System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fish has a base value that is multiplied by its rarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earned money can be invested in:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >equipment upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >specialized bait</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlocking new biomes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome contains a unique <strong>story item</strong> that can only be caught once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting all story items unlocks special events and deeper mysteries hidden beneath the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/1ec96330010022169705fe0efb12e49d.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/1ec96330010022169705fe0efb12e49d.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/1ec96330010022169705fe0efb12e49d.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 Technical Details</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics</strong><br>Low-poly 3D environments with a stylized visual style. Each biome features its own atmosphere and a dynamic <strong>day/night cycle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio</strong><br>Atmospheric soundtrack that adapts to each biome, with environmental sounds and fishing effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UI / UX</strong><br>Clean and easy-to-read interface with detailed statistics and information.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing fishing game with a unique twist: explore six different biomes in a post-apocalyptic world and catch over <strong>130 unique fish species</strong>. Every catch is documented with detailed descriptions and scientific facts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/e262ced1384aba0831f6a48364a17575.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/e262ced1384aba0831f6a48364a17575.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/e262ced1384aba0831f6a48364a17575.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐟 Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖 Extensive Fish Book</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>130 different fish species</strong> are waiting to be discovered. From common freshwater fish to rare and mysterious creatures, each species is uniquely designed with its own traits, weight ranges, and scientific background information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All discovered fish are automatically recorded in the <strong>Fish Book</strong>, where you can review:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Species descriptions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientific facts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal weight records</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch statistics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rarity tiers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your collection grows with every discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/6a434d09a61116827bfdae118e74c967.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/6a434d09a61116827bfdae118e74c967.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/6a434d09a61116827bfdae118e74c967.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 Six Unique Biomes to Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 <strong>Beach</strong><br>Calm coastal waters filled with diverse marine life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏢 <strong>City</strong><br>Urban waterways with adapted fish populations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚇 <strong>Subway</strong><br>Underground water systems hosting unusual species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 <strong>Forest</strong><br>Forest ponds and lakes with unique biodiversity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌵 <strong>Desert</strong><br>Rare oasis waters with extremely adapted fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❄️ <strong>Iceland</strong><br>Arctic seas inhabited by deep-sea species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❓ <strong>Secret</strong><br>???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome contains its own atmosphere, fish species, and hidden discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/32d96f81bb3d837107c633b00a7aa947.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/32d96f81bb3d837107c633b00a7aa947.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/32d96f81bb3d837107c633b00a7aa947.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏠 Central Hub</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between fishing expeditions you return to a <strong>central hub area</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >view your <strong>Fish Book</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >compare catches on the <strong>Leaderboards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >manage and sell your fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >upgrade your equipment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hub acts as your base before heading back out into the unknown waters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/8bc17d9c53ead6df334d3c81197ba4b3.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/8bc17d9c53ead6df334d3c81197ba4b3.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/8bc17d9c53ead6df334d3c81197ba4b3.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare your catches with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards track:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the <strong>largest fish caught</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rare discoveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >total fishing value</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the most dedicated anglers will reach the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌮 Food Truck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every fish needs to stay in your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the <strong>Food Truck</strong>, you can cook and sell fish to earn money. The value depends on species, rarity, and weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earned money can be invested into upgrades or specialized bait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/6f3b2050dbe3f4a210d23c91bb239c72.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/6f3b2050dbe3f4a210d23c91bb239c72.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/6f3b2050dbe3f4a210d23c91bb239c72.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚙️ Progression System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three upgrade categories allow you to continuously improve your fishing equipment:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grip</strong><br>Improves casting precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bait</strong><br>Increases the chance of rare catches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Line</strong><br>Reduces waiting time between bites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/969baf934ff4575d47409c8f3e82a1c9.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/969baf934ff4575d47409c8f3e82a1c9.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/969baf934ff4575d47409c8f3e82a1c9.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 Specialized Baits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different bait types can be purchased to target specific rarity tiers. This allows strategic fishing when hunting rare species.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹️ Gameplay Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise casting system with timing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythmic fishing mini-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economy system for selling fish and upgrading equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story items hidden within each biome</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Gameplay Loop</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fishing Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines classic fishing gameplay with modern mechanics and a <strong>small food-stand economy system</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After casting your line, you wait for a bite. Waiting time can be reduced through upgrades. Catching a fish triggers a <strong>skill-based mini-game</strong> focused on timing and reaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/a417fea9b246ace4284597ebd0db8e64.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/a417fea9b246ace4284597ebd0db8e64.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/a417fea9b246ace4284597ebd0db8e64.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collection &amp; Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caught fish can be:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sold for money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cooked and sold at the <strong>Food Truck</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >kept in your inventory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Fish Book</strong> automatically records all discovered species and personal records.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Biome System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome can be unlocked through the <strong>map menu</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different environments feature unique fish populations, atmosphere, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/ce95004ef06899220afb22c2c3592dbf.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/ce95004ef06899220afb22c2c3592dbf.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/ce95004ef06899220afb22c2c3592dbf.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📊 Game Content</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rarity Tiers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common — <strong>40% spawn rate</strong><br>Uncommon — <strong>30%</strong><br>Rare — <strong>15%</strong><br>Epic — <strong>10%</strong><br>Legendary — <strong>4%</strong><br>Exotic — <strong>1%</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient</strong> — Story items</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Economy System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fish has a base value that is multiplied by its rarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earned money can be invested in:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >equipment upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >specialized bait</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlocking new biomes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome contains a unique <strong>story item</strong> that can only be caught once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting all story items unlocks special events and deeper mysteries hidden beneath the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/1ec96330010022169705fe0efb12e49d.poster.avif?t=1778608627\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/1ec96330010022169705fe0efb12e49d.webm?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/extras/1ec96330010022169705fe0efb12e49d.mp4?t=1778608627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 Technical Details</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics</strong><br>Low-poly 3D environments with a stylized visual style. Each biome features its own atmosphere and a dynamic <strong>day/night cycle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio</strong><br>Atmospheric soundtrack that adapts to each biome, with environmental sounds and fishing effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UI / UX</strong><br>Clean and easy-to-read interface with detailed statistics and information.</p>", "short_description": "In abandoned biomes, forgotten cities, and lifeless waters, you cast your line — often without knowing whether it is still worth it. Rare fish, fragile systems, and a world without explanation create an atmosphere that observes rather than entertains.", "supported_languages": "English, German", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/086d1c597e2ea1b4918a6ad6163902bf8767bc48/header.jpg?t=1778608627", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/f3a945d7f6103722eaa8bfcabb50669bd85779a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778608627", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262030/f3a945d7f6103722eaa8bfcabb50669bd85779a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778608627", "website": "https://lucamuellerprod.web.app/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 660 / AMD Radeon HD 7850<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 / AMD RX 580<br></li><li